hide empty members
title Sales — Outbox publisher
class OutboxWorker {
 +tick(...)
}
interface OutboxRepository {
 +due(...)
+sent(...)
+defer(...)
}
interface EventPublisher {
 +publish(...)
}
class PrismaOutboxRepository
class RabbitMqPublisher
OutboxWorker --> OutboxRepository
OutboxWorker --> EventPublisher
PrismaOutboxRepository ..|> OutboxRepository
RabbitMqPublisher ..|> EventPublisher
note bottom of OutboxWorker
Poll mỗi2s; single replica, không lease nhiều replica.
due()/sent()/defer() theo OutboxRepository thực tế.
end note
